Well, I've finally ascended!  Chaotic wizard, which I suspect is the
easiest role to ascend (or maybe it's just my playing style).  I
rather overprepared... I was actually intending to polypile every
scroll, potion, ring and amulet in the game into something useful, but
eventually I realized that I could easily ascend, and forced myself to
go through with it.  I also polypiled a large number of gems, and
acquired some magic markers through wishing/polypiling that I used
more for spellbooks than for scrolls.

Pestilence and Famine ate Finger of Death spells whenever they came
close; Death I just ran past (he did shave ~20 points off my max
health).  Right up at the end, I had several wishes left over, so I
spent two on Zorkmids for ~20,000 more points.

No boots of speed all game, but the levitation boots turned out to be
just as good, considering that I hade both the hast spell and the
jumping spell (though as it turned out, I never jumped).  I used one
scroll of charging on the Astral Plane to recharge my Power.

An invisible choir sings, and you are bathed in radiance...--More--



